WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:09.112
Frank and Lisa were enjoying ice-cream cones with their grandpa.

2
00:00:09.132 --> 00:00:12.173
"How's your ice cream, Grandpa?"

3
00:00:12.653 --> 00:00:13.393
asked Lisa.

4
00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:17.135
"It's delicious," Grandpa replied.

5
00:00:17.155 --> 00:00:23.858
"As soon as we're finished with our ice cream, why don't we all go to watch the fireflies?"

6
00:00:26.799 --> 00:00:28.040
Frank and Lisa agreed.

7
00:00:28.352 --> 00:00:31.114
They all went out to the trees behind the ice-cream shop.

8
00:00:31.674 --> 00:00:34.496
It was dusk, and fireflies were everywhere.

9
00:00:34.516 --> 00:00:37.818
"Look! I caught a firefly!"

10
00:00:38.298 --> 00:00:39.178
shouted Frank.

11
00:00:39.198 --> 00:00:41.800
"Why does it glow?"

12
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.161
Lisa asked.

13
00:00:43.181 --> 00:00:45.402
"I don't know.

14
00:00:45.882 --> 00:00:48.824
Grandpa, what makes a firefly glow?"

15
00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:50.305
Frank asked.

16
00:00:50.325 --> 00:00:55.388
"That's a good question, Frank," said Grandpa.

17
00:00:57.208 --> 00:01:03.030
"Fireflies have a chemical in their stomach that glows when it comes in contact with oxygen.

18
00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:08.631
Did you also know that only the male fireflies glow?"

19
00:01:09.031 --> 00:01:10.052
Grandpa asked.

20
00:01:10.072 --> 00:01:13.052
"No, why is that?"

21
00:01:13.633 --> 00:01:14.373
said Frank.

22
00:01:15.413 --> 00:01:19.354
"The male firefly glows to attract the female fireflies.

23
00:01:21.435 --> 00:01:27.673
The faster he flickers, the more likely he will attract a female firefly," Grandpa explained.

24
00:01:27.693 --> 00:01:32.856
"Wow, you know so much about fireflies!"

25
00:01:33.297 --> 00:01:34.057
said Lisa.

26
00:01:34.698 --> 00:01:37.439
Lisa and Frank's parents and Grandma joined them.

27
00:01:37.459 --> 00:01:43.984
"When I was your age," continued Grandpa, "we used to light our house with fireflies."

28
00:01:44.004 --> 00:01:46.986
"Really?" shouted Lisa and Frank.

29
00:01:47.006 --> 00:01:49.888
"No," said Mom.

30
00:01:49.908 --> 00:01:52.249
"He's telling a tall tale."

31
00:01:52.269 --> 00:01:56.940
"It's getting late," said Grandma.

32
00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:58.341
"We should go."

33
00:01:58.361 --> 00:02:01.242
"Okay," Grandpa replied.

34
00:02:01.262 --> 00:02:08.126
"Everybody in the back of the truck, and remember the rules: No standing up and no sticking your

35
00:02:08.146 --> 00:02:09.706
hands outside the truck."

36
00:02:12.407 --> 00:02:14.308
Grandpa drove them safely home.

37
00:02:14.328 --> 00:02:17.470
"We're home," said Grandpa.

38
00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:22.132
"And your grandma and I have a surprise for you kids."

39
00:02:24.384 --> 00:02:26.965
Grandma led them to a bedroom and opened the door.

40
00:02:27.426 --> 00:02:28.846
Inside were bunk beds.

41
00:02:29.547 --> 00:02:33.709
"Your grandpa made these beds for you," said Grandma.

42
00:02:33.729 --> 00:02:36.591
"Cool," said Frank.

43
00:02:37.731 --> 00:02:39.432
"I'm sleeping in the top bunk."

44
00:02:40.833 --> 00:02:44.655
"I want to sleep in the top bunk," whined Lisa.

45
00:02:45.355 --> 00:02:49.958
"I'm sorry, Lisa," said Grandpa, "but Frank is older.

46
00:02:50.318 --> 00:02:51.959
He should sleep in the top bunk.

47
00:02:52.299 --> 00:02:53.880
Do you need help climbing up?"

48
00:02:55.396 --> 00:02:58.037
"No, but can you hand Terry to me?"

49
00:02:58.537 --> 00:02:59.218
asked Frank.

50
00:02:59.238 --> 00:03:01.999
"Terry?" Grandpa asked.

51
00:03:02.019 --> 00:03:07.661
"Terry is Frank's Tyrannosaurus rex," said Mom with a laugh.

52
00:03:07.681 --> 00:03:15.425
"Yeah, Terry is so ugly that he scares all the monsters away," added Frank.

53
00:03:16.105 --> 00:03:17.886
He had climbed up into bed.

54
00:03:17.906 --> 00:03:22.888
"Oh, I see," replied Grandpa as he handed Terry to Frank.

55
00:03:23.808 --> 00:03:25.950
"But there are no monsters in this house.

56
00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:28.772
I chased them all away when your mom was little."

57
00:03:28.792 --> 00:03:31.895
"It's true," said Mom.

58
00:03:31.915 --> 00:03:36.618
"Your grandpa is very good at scaring away monsters.

59
00:03:37.939 --> 00:03:38.500
Good night.

60
00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:41.362
I'll leave the door open and the hall light on."

61
00:03:41.382 --> 00:03:45.305
"Good night, Mom," said Frank.

62
00:03:45.766 --> 00:03:47.827
"Good night," said Lisa.

63
00:03:48.808 --> 00:03:51.710
In the middle of night, Frank dropped his dinosaur.

64
00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:53.332
"Oh, Terry!

65
00:03:53.896 --> 00:03:54.756
Are you okay?"

66
00:03:55.157 --> 00:03:55.877
he whispered.

67
00:03:55.897 --> 00:03:58.958
"Terry, are you okay?

68
00:03:59.318 --> 00:04:00.339
Are you scared?"

69
00:04:00.799 --> 00:04:01.539
said Lisa.

70
00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:04.181
Frank climbed down to get Terry.

71
00:04:04.201 --> 00:04:07.562
"Can Terry and I sleep with you and Dolly?"

72
00:04:08.062 --> 00:04:08.723
asked Frank.

73
00:04:08.743 --> 00:04:11.424
"Terry is afraid of the top bunk."

74
00:04:12.244 --> 00:04:14.985
"Okay," said Lisa sleepily.

75
00:04:15.005 --> 00:04:17.867
"Make sure Terry doesn't eat Dolly."

76
00:04:17.887 --> 00:04:20.568
"He won't," promised Frank.

77
00:04:21.544 --> 00:04:24.545
In the morning, Grandpa and Mom came to wake them up.

78
00:04:24.565 --> 00:04:27.947
"Frank, Lisa, it's time to get up.

79
00:04:28.287 --> 00:04:30.568
We're going to the lake," said Grandpa.

80
00:04:30.588 --> 00:04:34.289
"Okay," said Frank and Lisa.

81
00:04:34.309 --> 00:04:39.571
"Frank, why are you sleeping with Lisa?"

82
00:04:39.931 --> 00:04:40.612
asked Mom.

83
00:04:40.632 --> 00:04:44.733
"Terry fell out of the top bunk," said Frank.

84
00:04:44.753 --> 00:04:49.175
"I climbed down to get him, but he was too scared to go back.

85
00:04:49.635 --> 00:04:51.256
So we slept with Lisa."

86
00:04:52.721 --> 00:04:54.706
"It's true," replied Lisa.

87
00:04:54.726 --> 00:04:58.035
"And Terry promised not to eat Dolly."

88
00:04:58.917 --> 00:05:00.140
Everyone smiled.
